              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Every dealer listing we read gives 330 lb for the standard Grit Runner. Tru Grit does not publish a weight rating for the Grit Runner Elite, as TreadmillReviews.com also notes, so ask the dealer for it in writing.
              </p>
